+    blocker while the phase is an ordinary ACTIVE phase (SCOUT/BUILD/...).
+    `binding_brake` -- the ONE hard-stop truth shared by the router and the
+    admission guard -- then refuses every consequential tool as `WAIT_BLOCKED`,
